        {
            "title": "國星宇航首掛跌逾3.5%  每手帳面蝕88元",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國星宇航(06935)首掛，收跌3.53%，報24.02元，成交1.81億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一手100股，每手帳面蝕88元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"國星宇航官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/Adaspace-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"國星宇航官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/Adaspace-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">國星宇航官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公司今首掛，開報24.44港元，較招股價24.9元低1.85%，盤中曾回5.06%，高見24.02元 ; 午盤收報25.26港元，微升1.45%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公司全球發售3,012.1萬股，招股價定在24.9元，為下限定價，集資淨額約6.52億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公開發售超額認購2.4倍，國際配售輕微超額0.79倍。基石投資者兩位，認購約241萬股，佔發售股份的8%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17176838-%e5%9c%8b%e6%98%9f%e5%ae%87%e8%88%aa%e9%a6%96%e6%8e%9b%e8%b7%8c%e9%80%be3-5-%e6%af%8f%e6%89%8b%e5%b8%b3%e9%9d%a2%e8%9d%9588%e5%85%83",
