            "title": "全日收市｜AI科網爆小股災   港股收跌370點  一周計科指插逾6%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數全日跌370點，恒生科技指數跌逾3%，午後沽壓加劇，AI及科網股全線挫，資源及內銀靠穩，一周計恒指跌844點，科指跌逾6%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">港股 AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數全日跌370點或1.55%，報23,637，早段見23,930，跌78點或0.32%，為半日高位，跌幅隨即擴大，臨近收市低見23,776，跌232點或0.96%，為半日低位。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">港股 AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：勝宏科技官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260330_FI_source-web_300476.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：勝宏科技官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260330_FI_source-web_300476.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：勝宏科技官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"阿里巴巴。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/20260624_GL_source_ap_Alibaba.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"阿里巴巴。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/20260624_GL_source_ap_Alibaba.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">阿里巴巴。AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：龍湖官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：龍湖官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：龍湖官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/07/20230726_FI_source-web_中國石油_中石油-2.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/07/20230726_FI_source-web_中國石油_中石油-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">港股 AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：勝宏科技官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260330_FI_source-web_300476.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：勝宏科技官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"阿里巴巴。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/20260624_GL_source_ap_Alibaba.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">阿里巴巴。AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：龍湖官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：龍湖官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/07/20230726_FI_source-web_中國石油_中石油-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日跌118點或3.02%，報3,813 ; 恒生國企指數全日跌119點或1.48%，報7,937。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交1,958.57億元，全日北水淨流入23億。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指本周累跌844點或3.44%，科指累跌265點或6.49% ; 國指累跌337點或4.07%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指全日跌406點或1.69%，報23,578，低水60點 ; 科指期貨跌126點或3.21%，報3,800，低水13點 ; 國指期貨跌126點或1.57%，報7.921，低水13點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">午後市場進一步消化英偉達高層變動響，市場消息傳美國商務部擬禁止中國企業通過設於其他國家的數據中心，遠程存取先進的AI芯片（如Nvidia芯片）。新規最快於月內公布，受管制國家可能增加馬來西亞、新加坡、泰國等7個國家。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI硬件股及模型股全線挫，午後跌勢加劇，市場視為英偉達概念股，包括上游的勝宏科技 (02476)全日收挫13.46%，報100.3元 ; 英諾賽科(02577)跌5.1%，報26.4元 ; 鴻騰精密 (06088)挫5.54%，報2.65元 ; 中際旭創(03308)插9.39%，報588.5元 ; 聯想集團 (00992)瀉6.33%，報17.62元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">模型股智譜(02513)收跌10.04%，報408.4元 ; MINIMAX(00100)挫8.19%報152.4元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：勝宏科技官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260330_FI_source-web_300476.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：勝宏科技官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260330_FI_source-web_300476.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：勝宏科技官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">晶片股午後亦轉跌，華虹宏力(01347)挫6.1%，報72.3元 ; 中芯(00981)收跌0.45%，報48.52元 ; 天數智芯(09903)倒跌2.35%，報76.85元 ;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)午沽壓驟增，收挫3.47%，報90.55元，一度跌破90元關，成交144.87億居首，北水上午「抄底」支持股價，但午後不敵市場沽壓，股價追跌; 騰訊(00700)跌3.06%，報386.6元，集團下周公布季績，市場預期淨利按年跌8.7% ; 小米(01810)跌3.74%，報28.86元。三股合共推低恒指145點，成跌市主力。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"阿里巴巴。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/20260624_GL_source_ap_Alibaba.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"阿里巴巴。AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1024x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/20260624_GL_source_ap_Alibaba.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">阿里巴巴。AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">摩根大通亞洲TMT行業研究聯席主管Gokul Hariharan預期，人工智能(AI)基礎設施投資周期將再持續至少12個月，主要由Token需求急速增長及AI模型能力提升支持。當前，AI晶片供應維持嚴重緊缺，未來一年仍是AI發展主要樽頸。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">龍湖(00960)跌6.43%，報3.93元，為表現最差藍籌股 ;華潤置地(01109)及中海外(00688)分別跌3.55%及4.02%。美國加息壓力增加，內房股受壓。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：龍湖官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：龍湖官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：龍湖官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">新世界發展(00017)傳供股集資250億元，新世界今早停牌，港地產股受累走弱，恒基地產(00012)跌1.02%，報29.06元 ; 新鴻基地產(00016)跌1.34%，報110.9元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">油價上升，資源股造好，中石油(00857)升2.79%，報10.33元，為表現最佳藍籌，貢獻恒指8點 ; 中石化(00386)升1.71%，報4.75元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內銀撐市，工商銀行(01398)升1.09%報7.92元，貢獻恒指10點; 建行(00939)升0.58%，報10.5元 ; 中行(03988)升0.64%，報6.28元，合共貢獻恒指16點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/07/20230726_FI_source-web_中國石油_中石油-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/07/20230726_FI_source-web_中國石油_中石油-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：中國石油2022年度年報</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17176789-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%bd%9cai%e7%a7%91%e7%b6%b2%e7%88%86%e5%b0%8f%e8%82%a1%e7%81%bd-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c370%e9%bb%9e-%e4%b8%80%e5%91%a8%e8%a8%88%e7%a7%91%e6%8c%87",
