            "title": "A股午後跌勢加劇  深股跌逾2%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股收跌，午後市況大幅向下，近全日低位收市，深股跌逾2%，創板跌逾3%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20241107_FI_source-ap_AShare-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20241107_FI_source-ap_AShare-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">A股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指收跌21點或0.59%，報3,634，上午見3,669，升14點或0.38%，午後市況急速轉弱，最低見3,623，跌32點或0.87%，為全日低位。全日成交7,706.14億元(人民幣‧下同)。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指收跌207點或2.05%，報10,968，上午見11,253點高位，升56點或0.5%，午後拾級而下，低見10,941，瀉256點或2.28%，為全日低位，全日成交8,850.54億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指數跌83點或3.32%，報2,426 ; 滬深300報4,016，跌27點或0.68%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一周累計，滬綜指累跌15點或0.41%，深股累跌793點或7.09%。</p>\n</div>",
